  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.610" end="00:03.960" ttm:agent="v1">It's like a polaroid love</p>
      <p begin="00:03.960" end="00:07.680" ttm:agent="v1">Salang chonseuleon geu gamjeong</p>
      <p begin="00:07.680" end="00:11.360" ttm:agent="v1">Geunde nae gaseumi ttwieo</p>
      <p begin="00:11.360" end="00:14.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Wae na ilae na? (ya)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.890" end="00:17.870" ttm:agent="v1">Wae salange mog maeneun geonji?</p>
      <p begin="00:17.870" end="00:21.950" ttm:agent="v1">Eochapi ppeonhan gamjeongijanha</p>
      <p begin="00:21.950" end="00:25.180" ttm:agent="v1">Bunmyeong da anda mideossji</p>
      <p begin="00:25.180" end="00:28.740" ttm:agent="v1">Algodo ppajin hamjeonginga bwa</p>
      <p begin="00:28.740" end="00:35.730" ttm:agent="v1">Nado moleuge when you call my name</p>
      <p begin="00:35.730" end="00:42.620" ttm:agent="v1">Gaseum apeuge naui simjangi kungkung</p>
      <p begin="00:42.620" end="00:46.080" ttm:agent="v1">It's like a polaroid love</p>
      <p begin="00:46.080" end="00:49.670" ttm:agent="v1">Salang chonseuleon geu gamjeong</p>
      <p begin="00:49.670" end="00:52.840" ttm:agent="v1">Geunde nae gaseumi ttwieo</p>
      <p begin="00:52.840" end="00:56.560" ttm:agent="v1">Wae na ilae na?</p>
      <p begin="00:56.560" end="01:00.250" ttm:agent="v1">It's like a polaroid love</p>
      <p begin="01:00.250" end="01:03.340" ttm:agent="v1">Nae tteusdaelo doeji anha</p>
      <p begin="01:03.340" end="01:07.100" ttm:agent="v1">Heunhan filterjocha eobseo</p>
      <p begin="01:07.100" end="01:11.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But i love the vibe (yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:11.360" end="01:14.010" ttm:agent="v1">Neol hyanghan nae mameul yeogi</p>
      <p begin="01:14.010" end="01:17.270" ttm:agent="v1">Bojeong eobsi saegineun geoya</p>
      <p begin="01:17.270" end="01:20.840" ttm:agent="v1">Jeomjeom ttolyeoshaejyeo gaji</p>
      <p begin="01:20.840" end="01:24.480" ttm:agent="v1">I mameun sesang dan han jangppuniya</p>
      <p begin="01:24.480" end="01:31.610" ttm:agent="v1">Nado moleuge when you call my name</p>
      <p begin="01:31.610" end="01:38.240" ttm:agent="v1">Gaseum apeuge naui simjangi kungkung</p>
